o] [:db/add "114c6171-1764-50b5-957c-69744ce4b805" :answer-field/choices "3c3aaed6-834a-5c92-87ba-53d6c8e8e40f"] [:db/add "114c6171-1764-50b5-957c-69744ce4b805" :answer-field/choices "17e573e0-b978-5f73-882f-1ae771d12528"] [:db/add "114c6171-1764-50b5-957c-69744ce4b805" :answer-field/choices "e0c0c019-a0fa-55e0-b49b-7e44852e3ddb"] [:db/add "114c6171-1764-50b5-957c-69744ce4b805" :answer-field/choices "0548d90f-174f-5f87-92df-21df487cd095"] [:db/add "114c6171-1764-50b5-957c-69744ce4b805" :answer-field/choices "cb9d02f0-1d79-5b6d-bebc-9d80f773ac52"] [:db/add "114c6171-1764-50b5-957c-69744ce4b805" :answer-field/correct "17e573e0-b978-5f73-882f-1ae771d12528"] [:db/ensure "114c6171-1764-50b5-957c-69744ce4b805" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "44f4f65c-c394-5e85-92b2-88eebd3326dc" :question/id #uuid "44f4f65c-c394-5e85-92b2-88eebd3326dc"] [:db/add "44f4f65c-c394-5e85-92b2-88eebd3326dc" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}3 & -6 & 6 & -6 \\\\ -2 & 5 & -2 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 0 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "44f4f65c-c394-5e85-92b2-88eebd3326dc" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}3 & -6 & 6 & -6 \\\\ -2 & 5 & -2 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 0 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_1:=\\frac{1}{3}R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 5 & -2 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 0 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=R_2+2R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 0 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3-2R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -4 & 10\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3+R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=-\\frac{1}{2}R_3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot.\n\nThe corresponding triangular system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y+2z&=-2 \\\\ y+2z&=-6 \\\\ z&=-2\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nBack substitution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z&=-2 \\\\ y&=-6-(2)(-2)=-2 \\\\ x&=-2-(-2)(-2)-(2)(-2)=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $\\langle -2,-2,-2\\rangle$."] [:db/add "44f4f65c-c394-5e85-92b2-88eebd3326dc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "44f4f65c-c394-5e85-92b2-88eebd3326dc" :question/answer-fields "114c6171-1764-50b5-957c-69744ce4b805"] [:db/ensure "44f4f65c-c394-5e85-92b2-88eebd3326dc" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/questions "44f4f65c-c394-5e85-92b2-88eebd3326dc"] [:db/add "47d43134-ae72-5399-9bc1-0e6747c5cd93" :answer/id #uuid "47d43134-ae72-5399-9bc1-0e6747c5cd93"] [:db/add "47d43134-ae72-5399-9bc1-0e6747c5cd93" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "47d43134-ae72-5399-9bc1-0e6747c5cd93" :answer/value "\\langle 6,-1,-4\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "47d43134-ae72-5399-9bc1-0e6747c5cd93" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9d830626-688d-5ab2-90d4-8010bbe21569" :answer/id #uuid "9d830626-688d-5ab2-90d4-8010bbe21569"] [:db/add "9d830626-688d-5ab2-90d4-8010bbe21569" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9d830626-688d-5ab2-90d4-8010bbe21569" :answer/value "\\langle -2,-1,0\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "9d830626-688d-5ab2-90d4-8010bbe21569" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1c1aaeef-5a22-516e-b1a2-4039b2807541" :answer/id #uuid "1c1aaeef-5a22-516e-b1a2-4039b2807541"] [:db/add "1c1aaeef-5a22-516e-b1a2-4039b2807541" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1c1aaeef-5a22-516e-b1a2-4039b2807541" :answer/value "\\langle -10,-1,4\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "1c1aaeef-5a22-516e-b1a2-4039b2807541" :answer/validate] [:db/add "15efae9e-6c0c-5bdc-a13e-70bed9207c0c" :answer/id #uuid "15efae9e-6c0c-5bdc-a13e-70bed9207c0c"] [:db/add "15efae9e-6c0c-5bdc-a13e-70bed9207c0c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "15efae9e-6c0c-5bdc-a13e-70bed9207c0c" :answer/value "\\langle 2,-1,-2\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "15efae9e-6c0c-5bdc-a13e-70bed9207c0c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "10fbd33e-4d7d-5085-a406-cf65ce2846b3" :answer/id #uuid "10fbd33e-4d7d-5085-a406-cf65ce2846b3"] [:db/add "10fbd33e-4d7d-5085-a406-cf65ce2846b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "10fbd33e-4d7d-5085-a406-cf65ce2846b3" :answer/value "\\langle -6,-1,2\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "10fbd33e-4d7d-5085-a406-cf65ce2846b3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df" :answer-field/id #uuid "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df"] [:db/add "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df" :answer-field/choices "47d43134-ae72-5399-9bc1-0e6747c5cd93"] [:db/add "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df" :answer-field/choices "9d830626-688d-5ab2-90d4-8010bbe21569"] [:db/add "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df" :answer-field/choices "1c1aaeef-5a22-516e-b1a2-4039b2807541"] [:db/add "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df" :answer-field/choices "15efae9e-6c0c-5bdc-a13e-70bed9207c0c"] [:db/add "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df" :answer-field/choices "10fbd33e-4d7d-5085-a406-cf65ce2846b3"] [:db/add "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df" :answer-field/correct "47d43134-ae72-5399-9bc1-0e6747c5cd93"] [:db/ensure "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e6e99a08-cdaf-5e6f-82dd-2a007e322fb1" :question/id #uuid "e6e99a08-cdaf-5e6f-82dd-2a007e322fb1"] [:db/add "e6e99a08-cdaf-5e6f-82dd-2a007e322fb1" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & -2 & -4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & -7 \\\\ -2 & -1 & -5 & 9\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "e6e99a08-cdaf-5e6f-82dd-2a007e322fb1" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & -2 & -4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & -7 \\\\ -2 & -1 & -5 & 9\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_1:=-\\frac{1}{2}R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & -7 \\\\ -2 & -1 & -5 & 9\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=R_2-2R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -2 & -1 & -5 & 9\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3+2R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3-R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=-1R_3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot.\n\nThe corresponding triangular system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y+2z&=-3 \\\\ y&=-1 \\\\ z&=-4\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nBack substitution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z&=-4 \\\\ y&=-1-(0)(-4)=-1 \\\\ x&=-3-(1)(-1)-(2)(-4)=6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $\\langle 6,-1,-4\\rangle$."] [:db/add "e6e99a08-cdaf-5e6f-82dd-2a007e322fb1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "e6e99a08-cdaf-5e6f-82dd-2a007e322fb1" :question/answer-fields "41ac8eaf-0ee3-5a28-96e6-c928e075f5df"] [:db/ensure "e6e99a08-cdaf-5e6f-82dd-2a007e322fb1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/questions "e6e99a08-cdaf-5e6f-82dd-2a007e322fb1"] [:db/add "7a913220-4802-5812-952a-565a13f13a4e" :answer/id #uuid "7a913220-4802-5812-952a-565a13f13a4e"] [:db/add "7a913220-4802-5812-952a-565a13f13a4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7a913220-4802-5812-952a-565a13f13a4e" :answer/value "\\langle -1,-4,1\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "7a913220-4802-5812-952a-565a13f13a4e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3972c852-2abb-5bd8-85aa-de5ca53acc0e" :answer/id #uuid "3972c852-2abb-5bd8-85aa-de5ca53acc0e"] [:db/add "3972c852-2abb-5bd8-85aa-de5ca53acc0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3972c852-2abb-5bd8-85aa-de5ca53acc0e" :answer/value "\\langle -1,-10,4\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "3972c852-2abb-5bd8-85aa-de5ca53acc0e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "89da6886-c693-5003-87e2-7734db5bd442" :answer/id #uuid "89da6886-c693-5003-87e2-7734db5bd442"] [:db/add "89da6886-c693-5003-87e2-7734db5bd442" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "89da6886-c693-5003-87e2-7734db5bd442" :answer/value "\\langle -1,-8,3\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "89da6886-c693-5003-87e2-7734db5bd442" :answer/validate] [:db/add "502fb675-1e35-515c-842b-3817ab9b1ce7" :answer/id #uuid "502fb675-1e35-515c-842b-3817ab9b1ce7"] [:db/add "502fb675-1e35-515c-842b-3817ab9b1ce7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "502fb675-1e35-515c-842b-3817ab9b1ce7" :answer/value "\\langle -1,-2,0\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "502fb675-1e35-515c-842b-3817ab9b1ce7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cb3472aa-dc8b-546d-90c8-e2503d942a30" :answer/id #uuid "cb3472aa-dc8b-546d-90c8-e2503d942a30"] [:db/add "cb3472aa-dc8b-546d-90c8-e2503d942a30" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cb3472aa-dc8b-546d-90c8-e2503d942a30" :answer/value "\\langle -1,4,-3\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "cb3472aa-dc8b-546d-90c8-e2503d942a30" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424" :answer-field/id #uuid "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424"] [:db/add "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424" :answer-field/choices "7a913220-4802-5812-952a-565a13f13a4e"] [:db/add "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424" :answer-field/choices "3972c852-2abb-5bd8-85aa-de5ca53acc0e"] [:db/add "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424" :answer-field/choices "89da6886-c693-5003-87e2-7734db5bd442"] [:db/add "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424" :answer-field/choices "502fb675-1e35-515c-842b-3817ab9b1ce7"] [:db/add "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424" :answer-field/choices "cb3472aa-dc8b-546d-90c8-e2503d942a30"] [:db/add "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424" :answer-field/correct "89da6886-c693-5003-87e2-7734db5bd442"] [:db/ensure "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "61742d4d-f50c-53f6-8f65-c59bfa085c8a" :question/id #uuid "61742d4d-f50c-53f6-8f65-c59bfa085c8a"] [:db/add "61742d4d-f50c-53f6-8f65-c59bfa085c8a" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & 2 & 4 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "61742d4d-f50c-53f6-8f65-c59bfa085c8a" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & 2 & 4 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_1:=-\\frac{1}{2}R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=R_2+R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3-R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 5 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3-2R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot.\n\nThe corresponding triangular system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y-2z&=1 \\\\ y+2z&=-2 \\\\ z&=3\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nBack substitution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z&=3 \\\\ y&=-2-(2)(3)=-8 \\\\ x&=1-(-1)(-8)-(-2)(3)=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $\\langle -1,-8,3\\rangle$."] [:db/add "61742d4d-f50c-53f6-8f65-c59bfa085c8a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "61742d4d-f50c-53f6-8f65-c59bfa085c8a" :question/answer-fields "a48c4383-2e79-5297-a6f1-a1f430109424"] [:db/ensure "61742d4d-f50c-53f6-8f65-c59bfa085c8a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/questions "61742d4d-f50c-53f6-8f65-c59bfa085c8a"] [:db/add "9fa0fa80-ce9d-57c4-a168-69740ecbe671" :answer/id #uuid "9fa0fa80-ce9d-57c4-a168-69740ecbe671"] [:db/add "9fa0fa80-ce9d-57c4-a168-69740ecbe671" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9fa0fa80-ce9d-57c4-a168-69740ecbe671" :answer/value "x=-2,\\quad y=1,\\quad z=-2"] [:db/ensure "9fa0fa80-ce9d-57c4-a168-69740ecbe671" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f7ef2fe5-7e95-526e-82fc-59faaa906444" :answer/id #uuid "f7ef2fe5-7e95-526e-82fc-59faaa906444"] [:db/add "f7ef2fe5-7e95-526e-82fc-59faaa906444" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f7ef2fe5-7e95-526e-82fc-59faaa906444" :answer/value "x=2,\\quad y=-1,\\quad z=-4"] [:db/ensure "f7ef2fe5-7e95-526e-82fc-59faaa906444" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6e7927ee-1d15-5069-9c37-5f0cb5df68e1" :answer/id #uuid "6e7927ee-1d15-5069-9c37-5f0cb5df68e1"] [:db/add "6e7927ee-1d15-5069-9c37-5f0cb5df68e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6e7927ee-1d15-5069-9c37-5f0cb5df68e1" :answer/value "x=-12,\\quad y=6,\\quad z=3"] [:db/ensure "6e7927ee-1d15-5069-9c37-5f0cb5df68e1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "458e7415-61dc-520d-b953-a420474dddee" :answer/id #uuid "458e7415-61dc-520d-b953-a420474dddee"] [:db/add "458e7415-61dc-520d-b953-a420474dddee" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "458e7415-61dc-520d-b953-a420474dddee" :answer/value "x=-10,\\quad y=5,\\quad z=2"] [:db/ensure "458e7415-61dc-520d-b953-a420474dddee" :answer/validate] [:db/add "71f88625-c6bc-541f-8eb7-7c22bd5065c5" :answer/id #uuid "71f88625-c6bc-541f-8eb7-7c22bd5065c5"] [:db/add "71f88625-c6bc-541f-8eb7-7c22bd5065c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "71f88625-c6bc-541f-8eb7-7c22bd5065c5" :answer/value "x=-6,\\quad y=3,\\quad z=0"] [:db/ensure "71f88625-c6bc-541f-8eb7-7c22bd5065c5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9" :answer-field/id #uuid "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9"] [:db/add "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9" :answer-field/choices "9fa0fa80-ce9d-57c4-a168-69740ecbe671"] [:db/add "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9" :answer-field/choices "f7ef2fe5-7e95-526e-82fc-59faaa906444"] [:db/add "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9" :answer-field/choices "6e7927ee-1d15-5069-9c37-5f0cb5df68e1"] [:db/add "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9" :answer-field/choices "458e7415-61dc-520d-b953-a420474dddee"] [:db/add "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9" :answer-field/choices "71f88625-c6bc-541f-8eb7-7c22bd5065c5"] [:db/add "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9" :answer-field/correct "9fa0fa80-ce9d-57c4-a168-69740ecbe671"] [:db/ensure "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "593da203-f82a-5a4d-ac00-923d7df64cc1" :question/id #uuid "593da203-f82a-5a4d-ac00-923d7df64cc1"] [:db/add "593da203-f82a-5a4d-ac00-923d7df64cc1" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}3 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -4 & 10\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "593da203-f82a-5a4d-ac00-923d7df64cc1" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}3 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -4 & 10\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_1:=\\frac{1}{3}R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -4 & 10\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3-2R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -4 & 10\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3-2R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=-\\frac{1}{2}R_3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot.\n\nThe corresponding triangular system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y&=0 \\\\ y-z&=3 \\\\ z&=-2\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nBack substitution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z&=-2 \\\\ y&=3-(-1)(-2)=1 \\\\ x&=0-(2)(1)-(0)(-2)=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $\\langle -2,1,-2\\rangle$."] [:db/add "593da203-f82a-5a4d-ac00-923d7df64cc1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "593da203-f82a-5a4d-ac00-923d7df64cc1" :question/answer-fields "a6a7cac5-9fe9-5d7c-b3f0-2707b4125ab9"] [:db/ensure "593da203-f82a-5a4d-ac00-923d7df64cc1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/questions "593da203-f82a-5a4d-ac00-923d7df64cc1"] [:db/add "cc08b30f-1815-5a18-8153-bf3ee89b3997" :answer/id #uuid "cc08b30f-1815-5a18-8153-bf3ee89b3997"] [:db/add "cc08b30f-1815-5a18-8153-bf3ee89b3997" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cc08b30f-1815-5a18-8153-bf3ee89b3997" :answer/value "\\langle -11,3,-3\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "cc08b30f-1815-5a18-8153-bf3ee89b3997" :answer/validate] [:db/add "48c26eac-9bad-51ac-9d4b-59fdfbee99cc" :answer/id #uuid "48c26eac-9bad-51ac-9d4b-59fdfbee99cc"] [:db/add "48c26eac-9bad-51ac-9d4b-59fdfbee99cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "48c26eac-9bad-51ac-9d4b-59fdfbee99cc" :answer/value "\\langle -16,5,-4\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "48c26eac-9bad-51ac-9d4b-59fdfbee99cc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0890c363-0989-550e-9d05-72c3764ad588" :answer/id #uuid "0890c363-0989-550e-9d05-72c3764ad588"] [:db/add "0890c363-0989-550e-9d05-72c3764ad588" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0890c363-0989-550e-9d05-72c3764ad588" :answer/value "\\langle 14,-7,2\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "0890c363-0989-550e-9d05-72c3764ad588" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8ff837dd-7f17-5307-a786-00180c5195bb" :answer/id #uuid "8ff837dd-7f17-5307-a786-00180c5195bb"] [:db/add "8ff837dd-7f17-5307-a786-00180c5195bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8ff837dd-7f17-5307-a786-00180c5195bb" :answer/value "\\langle -1,-1,-1\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "8ff837dd-7f17-5307-a786-00180c5195bb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6053cf31-609d-5714-883c-9ad67438fe56" :answer/id #uuid "6053cf31-609d-5714-883c-9ad67438fe56"] [:db/add "6053cf31-609d-5714-883c-9ad67438fe56" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6053cf31-609d-5714-883c-9ad67438fe56" :answer/value "\\langle 24,-11,4\\rangle"] [:db/ensure "6053cf31-609d-5714-883c-9ad67438fe56" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf" :answer-field/id #uuid "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf"] [:db/add "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf" :answer-field/choices "cc08b30f-1815-5a18-8153-bf3ee89b3997"] [:db/add "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf" :answer-field/choices "48c26eac-9bad-51ac-9d4b-59fdfbee99cc"] [:db/add "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf" :answer-field/choices "0890c363-0989-550e-9d05-72c3764ad588"] [:db/add "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf" :answer-field/choices "8ff837dd-7f17-5307-a786-00180c5195bb"] [:db/add "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf" :answer-field/choices "6053cf31-609d-5714-883c-9ad67438fe56"] [:db/add "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf" :answer-field/correct "6053cf31-609d-5714-883c-9ad67438fe56"] [:db/ensure "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d620ed91-186c-5dad-a078-85246e1e4040" :question/id #uuid "d620ed91-186c-5dad-a078-85246e1e4040"] [:db/add "d620ed91-186c-5dad-a078-85246e1e4040" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+4y-2z&=-4 \\\\ -x-y+3z&=-1 \\\\ -x-4y-5z&=0\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "d620ed91-186c-5dad-a078-85246e1e4040" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}2 & 4 & -2 & -4 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -5 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_1:=\\frac{1}{2}R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -5 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=R_2+R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -5 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3+R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -6 & -2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3+2R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & -8\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=-\\frac{1}{2}R_3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot.\n\nThe corresponding triangular system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y-z&=-2 \\\\ y+2z&=-3 \\\\ z&=4\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nBack substitution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z&=4 \\\\ y&=-3-(2)(4)=-11 \\\\ x&=-2-(2)(-11)-(-1)(4)=24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $\\langle 24,-11,4\\rangle$."] [:db/add "d620ed91-186c-5dad-a078-85246e1e4040" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "d620ed91-186c-5dad-a078-85246e1e4040" :question/answer-fields "9b25359f-4016-5ac1-adbc-ec8f12b766bf"] [:db/ensure "d620ed91-186c-5dad-a078-85246e1e4040" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/questions "d620ed91-186c-5dad-a078-85246e1e4040"] [:db/ensure 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/validate]]
